<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-29T10:16:28.272Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 10:16:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Afghan Taliban mortar fire on the northwest Pakistan border killed one civilian and wounded five, while separate Afghan firing near Angoor Adda injured five people. Pakistan struck Taliban positions, destroyed border check posts, and began an operation against illegal Afghans in Peshawar on Nov 1. The Pakistani minister linked the border closure to rising LPG prices. A safety net prevented a drone attack on Hassankhel police station and arrest warrants were issued in the Radio Pakistan attack case. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/qatar-urges-iran-to-show-goodwill-by-ending-threats-to-the-region-and-reopening-the-strait&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1qdFJyLS1lS0FlMzJfamVPUVdBVXFvb1RxdjQyUXBsVmVaNTZqNHFaMWJ4TUlTeHpNU0tjZlJNNXBLcHctLXJJQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE44YmFIMmdTcEY4M3JjLWN1LXA3S3R6ME1aUUJrSldVeEJpSllnWTY3akF1dWdmbVRtZzFzQmp3WlRaV3prVzRlcg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5JNFNLTGlTSnNCSVk3ZEcyQWlXYVFYZHVzSDFUdURxdmdHVjZyWUdmRlpmd1pfbG84UDNmSnRzaUlEWWNUckpKbA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQMl9GeFk5TXhOMVRqRlE0VWEtU29aT3ZEbTVxbm43Y1NDb21abDAwTmI1Tjk2Mmo4eVdVZTZmSnhXZkc4U1pxeUoyMHFteHMwWTJLT3ZTeFJfMmt6QW51dk5pblZuaFdfdmdzTmxmLXh6MUQ4aUJIZDNweUlvZ1U3dDBGWngtRVRCYkR2UFJ4Wkxac2U1T1ZNTHRkVWNTa2o4N0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5pcEIxa2VweDl4MTU3ajN4UEQwa3dNRXBJWHc0cmxYX3FHRFViYVJibF84eldZWExCc1dUNU5